## Safety Metrics

### Key Performance Indicators

| Metric | FY2025 Target | FY2025 Actual |
|--------|---------------|---------------|
| TRIR (Total Recordable) | <0.80 | 0.82 |
| LTIR (Lost Time) | <0.20 | 0.18 |
| Fatalities | 0 | 0 |
| Near Misses Reported | >2,000 | 2,450 |
| Safety Training Hours | >50,000 | 52,000 |

### Reporting Requirements

| Event | Report To | Timeframe |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| Fatality | CEO + OSHA | Immediately (8 hrs OSHA) |
| Hospitalization | VP EHS + OSHA | 24 hours |
| Recordable Injury | EHS Manager | 24 hours |
| Near Miss | Supervisor | Same day |
| Unsafe Condition | Supervisor/EHS | Immediately |

