## Incident Investigation

### Investigation Process

| Step | Action | Timeframe |
|------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Secure scene, first aid | Immediate |
| 2 | Initial notification | <2 hours |
| 3 | Investigation start | <24 hours |
| 4 | Root cause analysis | <7 days |
| 5 | Corrective actions | Per severity |
| 6 | Close-out | <30 days |

### Investigation Levels

| Severity | Investigation Level |
|----------|---------------------|
| Near Miss | Supervisor |
| First Aid | EHS + Supervisor |
| Recordable | EHS Manager |
| Serious | VP EHS + Team |
| Fatality | CEO + External |

